/**
 * Stateless MCP 2026-07-28 Streamable HTTP endpoint supporting server/discover, tools/list, and tools/call. Requests require the protocol's per-request metadata and matching MCP-Protocol-Version, Mcp-Method, and, for tools/call, Mcp-Name headers. Only explicitly approved unauthenticated HTTPS GET operations from the latest stored specification are discoverable and executable.
 * @summary Discover or invoke approved MCP tools
 */
